{
  "_doc": [
    "Buff buildings (journal: buff_buildings_journal.md). Five interactive",
    "buildings scattered over the islands, each granting a short timed buff.",
    "`buffs` is the per-kind tuning; `obstacles`, `obstacle_decor` and `rigs`",
    "are merged into terrain.json's blocks at load (game/content.py) so the",
    "generator, the bake and the renderer see the buildings as ordinary",
    "obstacle kinds, and `image_rigs` (single images: the HUD stills, the",
    "pinball) into the UI rigs. `dressing` lists the non-colliding props",
    "scattered round each building at bake time and `colliders` the ordinary",
    "obstacles the generator seats beside it."
  ],
